:: bed {"position":"700,825"}
<<scenery bed>>
<<if $player.sleeping>>\
	As the sun reveals the world to a nice <<- Now.getWeekDay()>> morning, you climb out of bed, ready to start a new day. <<- either("The birds chip happily in the morning sun and the trees rustle alive in the early breeze.", "The morning sun shines through your room, illuminating it in a nice warm glow.")>>
<<else>>\
	You currently stand in the middle of your cozy small bedroom.
<</if>>\
<<if $player.sleeping && OnlineStore.pendingOrder()>>
    Someone is knocking at the front door!!
    Who might that be?
    <<keyOption [[Go check|receivePacket]] 🚪>>
<<else>>
    <<unlessEmergency>>\
        <<keyOption [[Leave your room|main]] 🚪>>
        <<keyOption [[Watch porn|watchPorn]] 💗>>: 30min
        <<keyOption [[Shop online using your laptop|onlineStore]] 🛒>>
        <<if !$player.job or $player.workedToday or Now.isWeekend()>>\
            <<keyAction Sleep 😴>><<sleep>><</keyAction>>
        <</if>>\
    <</unlessEmergency>>\
<</if>>
<<set $player.sleeping to false>>
:: main {"position":"700,650"}
<<scenery mainRoom>>
You are currently standing in the middle of the main room of your house.

''Is there something you want to do in here?''
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<keyOption [[Watch TV|watchTv]] 📺>>: 30min
    <<include workOption>>\
    <<keyOption [[Go outside|home]] 🚪>>
    <<keyOption [[The Basement|basement]] 🔒>>
    <<keyOption [[Your Bedroom|bed]] 🛌>>
<</unlessEmergency>>\
:: watchTv {"position":"875,825"}
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through channels and shows.@@
<<include main>>\
:: watchPorn {"position":"600,1000"}
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through porn and jerking off.@@
<<include bed>>\
